SOAPBOX: QRP - 5 Watts - to a short INDOOR Wire,
SOAPBOX: Outside antenna down for QTH painting.
SOAPBOX: SO ... Used an INDOOR end-fed wire.
SOAPBOX: Nothing keeps this QRPer off the air!
SOAPBOX: WPX each year - My GOAL: Work as many
SOAPBOX: Countries as possible on each band used,
SOAPBOX: NO assistance, no Internet or cluster spots,
SOAPBOX: Just spinning the BIG KNOB and pouncing.
SOAPBOX: 100% S&P, DX ONLY, NO "Lower 48" QSOs.
SOAPBOX: All contacts with short INDOOR wire antenna.
SOAPBOX: I ended up with 47 DX QSOs in 19 Countries.
SOAPBOX: What a blast! Nothing beats a CW Contest!
SOAPBOX: ( Even if you only have an indoor wire :-)
SOAPBOX: TNX to all for your patience and the QSOs.
SOAPBOX: Go Arizona Outlaws! -73- John N6HI
